text = "Get score in the form of harvest seasons which happen every
10 seconds. Every harvest grants you 1 random seed to plant 
somewhere in the map, but be weary! Every 20 seconds there's
a natural disaster that randomly occurs which can range from
mundane to devastating. You lose when all of your plants die.
There are plants that give you more Harvest (producers), and those who's sole job is to be your plant's bodyguards (defenders). Good luck :)
 ESC TO CANCEL PLANT PLACEMENT
 MOUSE1 TO CLICK PLANT & HOVER OVER THEM FOR MORE INFO"
